{30}{You can WIN on the first roll. If the pips on the dice add up to SEVEN or ELEVEN then you are a WINNER on the FIRST THROW. If you roll eyes of the snake, a TWO, you lose. If you haven't won or lost on the first throw, then you remember the number, what is known as SETTING your MARK.}{You can WIN on the first roll. If the pips on the dice add up to SEVEN or ELEVEN then you are a WINNER on the FIRST THROW. If you roll eyes of the snake, a TWO, you lose. If you haven't won or lost on the first throw, then you remember the number, what is known as SETTING your MARK.}{}{}{}{ } 
